# SMTP Component

Email notification adapter that delivers monitoring events via SMTP with TLS support and comprehensive error tracking.

## Key Integration Pattern
Implements dual SMTP delivery modes - direct TLS connection with manual control flow for detailed error tracking, and standard smtp.SendMail for non-TLS connections.

## Important Constraints
- Track granular error types (dial, TLS, auth, sender, recipient, data, write) in Prometheus metrics
- Support both authenticated and anonymous SMTP connections
- Always use Bcc for recipient lists to protect email privacy